        "created_at": "2013-01-31T17:56:53.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>To all of you that are going I am also going.  We should play games together.</p>\n<p>You’ll know it’s me because I look like a giant viking biker. If you see a giant viking biker it’s probably me and I’m much friendlier than I look.</p>\n<p>Also I probably won’t have my copy of Sentinels with me because I’m taking a bus and have super limited bag space. So bring yours or convince your friends to buy a copy.</p>",
