        "created_at": "2013-01-31T18:45:54.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Orphanleni\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/orphanleni/48/2421_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Orphanleni:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>To all of you that are going I am also going. We should play games together.</p>\n<p>You'll know it's me because I look like a giant viking biker. If you see a giant viking biker it's probably me and I'm much friendlier than I look.</p>\n<p>Also I probably won't have my copy of Sentinels with me because I'm taking a bus and have super limited bag space. So bring yours or convince your friends to buy a copy.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Great&nbsp;prank?&nbsp; Everyone who goes, dress up as a viking biker.</p>",
